wine-sg (10.0-5) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Windows.Web.Http: response headers (Stained Glass patch 0029). winget reads
    and iterates a response's headers after each request; add the response
    header collection (typed IHttpResponseHeaderCollection + IMap<HSTRING,HSTRING>
    + IIterable), built from winhttp's raw header block. winget now reads the
    status and every header of its package source over real HTTPS.

