wine-sg (10.0-4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Implement Windows.Web.Http in windows.web.dll (Stained Glass patch 0028):
    the WinRT HTTP stack winget uses to reach a package source -- filter,
    HttpClient, HttpMethod, HttpRequestMessage, HttpStringContent, the typed
    header collections, HttpResponseMessage and a pre-completed async operation,
    with the transport driven by winhttp. Real winget-cli now sends real HTTPS
    requests to cdn.winget.microsoft.com and reads the responses.

